"⟪k:98⟫Fazia vários dias desde que deixei a capital,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_33F331FB_3B9E_4EA0_8FAD_EE5D288F0047
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6dd64b829b06ae472789986ace6a76a293c7f08846c741f6e8b80fadce7fb17
#. default-sha256: af3297d50783107eef2f26b44d3d198fb84bbda16470fbe72808a43167306628
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_33F331FB_3B9E_4EA0_8FAD_EE5D288F0047"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and I could still see it when I closed my eyes—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the people lined up on the Grand-"
"Pont, awaiting entry, eager to start a new life there. Brimming with hope."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫e eu ainda podia ver quando fechava meus olhos—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫as pessoas fazendo fila na Grand-"
"Pont, esperando a entrada, ansiosas para começar uma nova vida ali. Cheias de esperança."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C39F9F6A_183B_4DDB_A881_45B70456269D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 97587e322acc63630e695912cbd40d3cf586699e3201c18432b81d8a29802a75
#. default-sha256: 52ecdf2069ac6387036bf421dbf999e2cfdb9187ad9299dea2ff36b7460fda51
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C39F9F6A_183B_4DDB_A881_45B70456269D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was a city people were willing to pay high taxes to live in. ⟪k:1⟫If you were a "
"performer, you could get some of those costs shaved down a bit by putting those skills to use."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era uma cidade onde as pessoas estavam dispostas a pagar altos impostos para viver. ⟪k:1⟫Se "
"você fosse um artista, poderia reduzir um pouco os custos usando essas habilidades."

#: scenario5:scenario5_26677462_ADE3_4BCD_9D74_5E3630194480
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 173fdf3885329f264e7dc7781d7d808d15c5deefbfa90165a8b36442af6bfcb2
#. default-sha256: 8cb54fb01206e99afae3e32446aa48cc476918c85fb644abcdb9bf6ab6b4d6c4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_26677462_ADE3_4BCD_9D74_5E3630194480"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The capital was harsh on those who wanted in, and apathetic about all who left."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫A capital era dura com quem queria entrar e apática com todos os que partiam."

#: scenario5:scenario5_02C0E224_2F80_400F_9C6C_FAF317D2E77B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 31fe133ec1a7449259af660db262a392ba65669aef0ceee35ff39b4fec99e9ec
#. default-sha256: e89034cd7e260fc0c2ab500ab37304bb443a39e5c890063817b7a19537414e1a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_02C0E224_2F80_400F_9C6C_FAF317D2E77B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was composed of a powerful nobility and clergy,⟪k:1⟫wealthy merchants and bankers, and a "
"large population of poor.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And it was the city I had called home for a long time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era composta por uma poderosa nobreza e clero,⟪k:1⟫ricos comerciantes e banqueiros, e uma "
"grande população de pobres.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫E era a cidade que eu chamava de lar há muito tempo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_0D8680B1_13DD_4A05_BAC7_9E3F46D46FE1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e86b659d4a9446d78063240a4f52ca318095e868da7d35c80d80227044b77ed0
#. default-sha256: 92672d96c0b8ef59b2351143157bf9e59d06ee4f32a54b905f5cc6afae09146d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0D8680B1_13DD_4A05_BAC7_9E3F46D46FE1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I didn’t know much about where I was heading."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eu não sabia muito sobre para onde estava indo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_243EDDDE_2A71_471E_9D8D_F337753DCE30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0a3f92125de2b554b97b0256c8eeb005844bacd63204f28ad220d5fa2c60478b
#. default-sha256: 5706705f1c25a9bc4563fc12777825d3a889720e99bc2a0f629c1b93172df0df
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_243EDDDE_2A71_471E_9D8D_F337753DCE30"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s getting foggy.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Looks like it might rain..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Está ficando enevoado.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Parece que vai chover..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F230F2D6_8532_49D3_A3DF_12B864EF04DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9bc837fd9f9a39523be999dfc850f9952fb14cee095df8e1cc176397e4f3272
#. default-sha256: 1701145f0788f6b5a3e8fae301482da9aebad73ea14df356582ec8c820b949a1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F230F2D6_8532_49D3_A3DF_12B864EF04DC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maybe we should take a little break.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You want to keep going? ⟪k:3⟫Oh... ⟪k:4⟫all "
"right, then."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Talvez devêssemos fazer uma pequena pausa.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Você quer continuar? ⟪k:3⟫Ah... ⟪k:4⟫"
"tudo bem, então."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C4A27F9D_E130_4C26_A5E3_DE9EB7EFA48A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8453cdb0be16df96a62327f58ec201ad74ee462a13b8cc77ec141dd08b95e388
#. default-sha256: fbb54c042bc69f05576d16a575639eaa9630914579df62370798e3fe409019ab
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C4A27F9D_E130_4C26_A5E3_DE9EB7EFA48A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The coachman was frustratingly taciturn.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He acted as though he had gotten stuck "
"transporting a prisoner."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O cocheiro era frustrantemente taciturno.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ele agia como se tivesse sido obrigado a "
"transportar um prisioneiro."

#: scenario5:scenario5_558A6AD7_0E76_4ACA_A939_D04D8B50B6CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e0d2932df7bf8517929dd141a0b90de056c919c1f0d5a652663dce9e1672dd90
#. default-sha256: f7b2f1b55610ec8d888574da2f57600741ae32c801f5f79c4fa091353c2fa845
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_558A6AD7_0E76_4ACA_A939_D04D8B50B6CD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though that was hardly a stretch.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫From his point of view, I was nothing more than a "
"criminal."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Embora isso dificilmente fosse um exagero.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Do ponto de vista dele, eu não passava "
"de uma criminosa."

#: scenario5:scenario5_BB19F393_A642_451F_8F7D_F2176A9002B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2244fb3436fa941cdf8aeca26390f459ef51a66f80d576b4053ba1a4d1c6f3b4
#. default-sha256: 8e3b30f55812c1b15e3719c87438bafad99eb968097724e8edd3fa30c6110b95
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BB19F393_A642_451F_8F7D_F2176A9002B7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Even the times he ⟪k:1⟫would⟪k:2⟫ acknowledge I had said anything,⟪k:3⟫he made no effort to "
"hide the scorn in his eyes—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mesmo nas vezes que ele ⟪k:1⟫decidia⟪k:2⟫ considerar que eu tinha dito alguma coisa,⟪k:3⟫ele "
"não fez nenhum esforço para esconder o desprezo em seus olhos—"

#: scenario5:scenario5_466146D6_F1B1_6580_2D64_293899220B4D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb88938bde23993ea5a6f811687e1cf8df2defdd46fd6bf1c9e56c280d85c7db
#. default-sha256: f94f3b834b23cdbfbd198304d565e47d7c1f86774136dd7b9662cbfc61840cc3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_466146D6_F1B1_6580_2D64_293899220B4D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫to pretend he didn’t regret ever taking this job."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫fingir que não se arrependia de ter aceitado este trabalho."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B8E68FA2_A545_4169_9059_9C36AD382CAC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 20a707b72c868fc2a30f678f075808d08c4c29923b3b192783d3d72c97bb7987
#. default-sha256: ef13f65af4e5cf42f19ad09139048f757c2bbf2988118d3437eb0708321b7083
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B8E68FA2_A545_4169_9059_9C36AD382CAC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And I would just fall silent again."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E eu só caía em silêncio novamente."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D22A8F79_4093_4ECA_A424_A935EA9A4C11
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6efc705f3128cd902180e6e085e74e4b8cdc9ca807d80eac65ce49750964cc72
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D22A8F79_4093_4ECA_A424_A935EA9A4C11"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario5:scenario5_43D63C0F_8592_41D8_900A_AA88FCBA99B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 835b96c991e9d3c01fb99ece8d6c7f158224657c8ee954374fce8d4405e8e6fb
#. default-sha256: 9fee8abe457d8e54a10158f90c9bb4c2fcea9ff3504dd80163bb7625eec92e37
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_43D63C0F_8592_41D8_900A_AA88FCBA99B4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The road was gradually getting narrower. ⟪k:1⟫We had long since left the paved city roads "
"behind, and were now traveling along a couple worn-down grooves in the forest."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A estrada foi ficando gradualmente mais estreita. ⟪k:1⟫Há muito que deixamos as estradas "
"pavimentadas da cidade para trás e agora estávamos viajando por alguns sulcos desgastados na "
"floresta."

#: scenario5:scenario5_700D2A4A_0C2C_41DC_BD73_97D66A1EE5E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0f53a19ec25e10a7fd5b6841e8ce61e7ccb2de5f48576a608cfbebba7d732ff
#. default-sha256: 0a2cdbd029a948d27d69b9f05ed45bdc0265dcd5e37e483e1e029590f21bdce7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_700D2A4A_0C2C_41DC_BD73_97D66A1EE5E4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How did I end up here?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Como eu vim parar aqui?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_EC5CA542_9964_464C_8906_7088635DD6F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9de4122d7c5e12186af7509ad46647e344ee70ee28fe4875ecf568973f1be4b
#. default-sha256: e113575dde146ec82c61e18471eeb849126b892d03402d367ebb1b8f0bae974e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_EC5CA542_9964_464C_8906_7088635DD6F9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why was I being subjected to this?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Por que eu estava sendo submetida a isto?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F1EA44A1_5550_4484_8F5E_5BEED899409A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2a626b1611199f0ed9d39fa1ee393e78df55ba7c7a96ac9f60154a3d41339d2
#. default-sha256: 48709e4d00105438a5cdabc20660626538c79070bc654e2c3912c53e7fcdfb40
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F1EA44A1_5550_4484_8F5E_5BEED899409A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was done thinking about it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eu estava farta de pensar nisso."

#: scenario5:scenario5_949B46C1_BD03_4443_B59F_6A51F6E99047
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd6114cab4aad1b61c7e6f0d85ccb756907aa2ec90a7900976cfe561c7bfb943
#. default-sha256: f615931b4400969ac59b81c1aa4587a709b7a53e052a6c5a207c9c4478ecba8f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_949B46C1_BD03_4443_B59F_6A51F6E99047"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The more I thought on it, the less fair it seemed.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The more I remembered, the worse "
"it hurt."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quanto mais eu pensava, menos justo parecia.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quanto mais eu me lembrava, pior doía."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D10A655E_0014_49DF_B57A_4464CB59EE1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed8a04c25bd08fcbe8d4951136b2f76f714a400b7ecaa7f2277742b0ba55a33d
#. default-sha256: d9ba9bd798127ff9f5602dc6df0ddaa8ba8b648882407a3244486e10cd33091a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D10A655E_0014_49DF_B57A_4464CB59EE1C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫All I could do anymore was close my eyes and weather the storm."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tudo o que eu podia fazer agora era fechar os olhos e resistir à tempestade."

#: scenario5:scenario5_FC1D2D85_AF57_4F40_9F84_7C36761A027F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 190bace0bc5007212eb83e99ca7d6db7e62c9beda5a18ffd56d01e136a968ef1
#. default-sha256: 0c3ef77ac874679b810514e668a51b2fee385cba35e49f6af199eb190c02f770
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_FC1D2D85_AF57_4F40_9F84_7C36761A027F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Deep within the dense woods, a mansion appeared before us like the world fading into view "
"after a dream."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nas profundezas da floresta densa, uma mansão surgiu diante de nós como o mundo aparecendo "
"depois de um sonho."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A799B4C7_858A_400E_BCC4_6CAF6CD70413
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb606b2b1a875f439ab9a5402a06796012a69be2c259d41a21fbc3f291cfd7ae
#. default-sha256: 939478973039dfb52826d67bf6dddce4a3519f1af173965f282cd28143224f05
