"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The door was heavy, and though it seemed to protest my attempts to "
"enter, it still opened much easier than I was expecting. ⟪k:5⟫I was worried over nothing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫A porta era pesada e, embora parecesse protestar contra minhas "
"tentativas de entrar, ela ainda se abriu muito mais fácil do que eu esperava. ⟪k:5⟫Eu me "
"preocupei por nada."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5E96A4D5_B182_48CD_A393_D3FE2E56272F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c03b8ec227cd4d877369cb8f9f1313ba82742f352ae340e14bc14b6c584dedcd
#. default-sha256: f2bb9b013eac98d4977bb6fd2eb2442d644bec986eac2730cf581d434c53e6a8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5E96A4D5_B182_48CD_A393_D3FE2E56272F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Looking in, I got the strangest impression that light was being swallowed up into the "
"mansion’s depths."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Olhando para dentro, tive a estranha impressão de que a luz estava sendo engolida pelas "
"profundezas da mansão."

#: scenario5:scenario5_3F907F55_0D51_441D_A556_94B54A631800
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
