msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Rather than going ⟪k:1⟫inside⟪k:2⟫, it felt as though I was about to step outside the "
"boundaries of this world."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ao invés de ir ⟪k:1⟫para dentro⟪k:2⟫, parece que estou prestes a sair dos limites deste "
"mundo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_25B6144A_65A8_4DD9_99AC_EB85CDC4080B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 314168747ca97d015a9e9119b90dd6373d538f0e590c482da5aa97c748ceeee9
