msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Droga... ⟪k:1⟫nem um pingo de luz."

#: scenario5:scenario5_0839D5A2_76A3_4479_9250_FA63C9F2229C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 39296c7205c8db187da30c7cef5f40098ea3e839cef9fbe11f915f73e2d975dd
#. default-sha256: 742af3f90555463247d0704aa1e2bed6b348d9ae4d20684adb0a3f1a51bdaba2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0839D5A2_76A3_4479_9250_FA63C9F2229C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I couldn’t even see my hand waving in front of my face.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It felt as though the floor "
"would fall out from under me and I would sink into eternal darkness if I didn’t watch my step."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu não conseguia nem ver minha mão acenando na frente do meu rosto.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Parecia que o "
"chão ia cair debaixo de mim e eu afundaria na escuridão eterna se não prestasse atenção no meu "
"passo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_BF3C5408_3F37_4E00_9647_CAEEE588D2F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 20ee7c76a5659766b2aa72030b92e4114b3ddcc1c79d5d5093c3cba861af883d
#. default-sha256: c85f3156edaaaa0991d5cb18530fb31f32af55a3dbb0ea817f0cb83852ce3e09
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BF3C5408_3F37_4E00_9647_CAEEE588D2F1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Fighting back that fear, I slowly walked forward, tracing the wall with my hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Lutando contra esse medo, caminhei lentamente para frente, traçando a parede com a mão."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F5D7FD38_6FA8_4927_8806_A282F02466B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d5a3c7d5c4da8e7a807da3a445062f46a0a9139f58d3a2d250a8f0eeabf381e4
