msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫There was a door at the end of a long corridor. I pulled it open, and a wisp of "
"bone-chilling air brushed past me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Havia uma porta no final de um longo corredor. Eu a abri e uma lufada de ar de "
"gelar os ossos passou por mim."

#: scenario5:scenario5_48E48AA0_6569_4B21_A769_E3A46A9FC003
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f84bbaf1858813e70db580c080f5caaf632cc49b49c075f9cd3204539516601
