msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_48E48AA0_6569_4B21_A769_E3A46A9FC003"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was too dark to see anything, but I could feel something ⟪k:1⟫different⟪k:2⟫ present in "
"this area than the rest of the house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Estava escuro demais para ver qualquer coisa, mas eu podia sentir algo ⟪k:1⟫diferente⟪k:2⟫ "
"nesta área que não estava presente no resto da casa."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5C7D8D1A_F976_4877_91A1_2CB164E9C884
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 345bd78598ac4dd3773b9427f5a56fa6fdc411825f2b0b7171b62e7113ccc19e
