msgid "⟪k:0⟫Uneasiness gripped me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫A inquietação tomou conta de mim."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F949FB49_0ED6_48BD_BA6D_AEC4B9AE13C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
