msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As I pushed forward through the freezing air,⟪k:1⟫for a split second, I spotted a shimmer of "
"light."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Enquanto eu avançava pelo ar gelado,⟪k:1⟫por uma fração de segundo, vejo um cintilar de luz."

#: scenario5:scenario5_0BC2FFE7_19E0_44DB_8429_50B92FACAC3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4c68422d164cb1f5c9d47e53cbfa629001572f63146ea2fa292d7844495baa3
