msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Squinting my eyes, I was able to make out a large window.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Unlike the others, it "
"wasn’t shuttered."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Apertando os olhos, consegui distinguir uma grande janela.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ao contrário das outras, "
"não estava fechada."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2DA6D4A5_42A2_4C27_B961_7871B7674FAB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 35fdc13c165740028fa12649f00403f1d694bba7db20dc0f9b5bf701e42d3b96
