msgid "⟪k:0⟫What do we have here?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Drapes? ⟪k:3⟫I see a little light beyond—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫O que temos aqui?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Cortinas? ⟪k:3⟫Eu vejo um pouco de luz através—"

#: scenario5:scenario5_562B7D5B_F18A_40F6_863E_CF87BDFCCC01
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
