msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My chances were slim, I imagined, but if there was even a ⟪k:1⟫slight⟪k:2⟫ possibility of "
"getting some light in here, it was worth a shot. ⟪k:3⟫So I pulled open the drapes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Minhas chances eram mínimas, eu imaginei, mas se houvesse mesmo que uma ⟪k:1⟫pequena⟪k:2⟫ "
"possibilidade de obter alguma luz aqui, valia a pena tentar. ⟪k:3⟫Então eu abri as cortinas."

