"colorful light shone down on me.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫It was a stained-glass window."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫No momento seguinte, uma luz "
"fraca, mas colorida, brilhou sobre mim.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Era um vitral."

#: scenario5:scenario5_CF0DBDF1_4A42_4E67_B2E9_56CF1C9D6DEF
