msgid "⟪k:0⟫The different colors of light blended into a milky white—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫dim but wondrous."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫As diferentes cores de luz misturadas em um branco leitoso—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫opaco, mas maravilhoso."

